<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-COLLATED AFRICAN WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COLLATED AFRICAN WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of the African group qualifying matches played at the weekend:</p>
<p>Group One:</p>
<p>In Conakry:</p>
<p>Guinea 3 Kenya 1 (halfime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Guinea - Aboubacar Titi Camara (17th min), Fode Camara (33rd), Momo Wandel Soumah (83rd)</p>
<p>Kenya - Mike Okoth (7th)</p>
<p>In Lagos:</p>
<p>Nigeria 2 Burkina Faso 0 (0-0) Scorer: Daniel Amokachi (46th, 75th)</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under matches played, won, drew, lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>    Guinea	  1  1  0  0  3  1  3</p>
<p>    Nigeria	 1  1  0  0  2  0  3</p>
<p>    Kenya	   1  0  0  1  1  3  0</p>
<p>Burkina Faso  1  0  0  1  0  2  0</p>
<p>Group Two:</p>
<p>In Cairo:</p>
<p>Egypt 7 Namibia 1 (4-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Egypt - Aly Maher (1st, 15th, 70th), Ahmed Hassan (11th), Ibrahim Hassan (35th), Hossam Hassan (73rd, 84th)</p>
<p>Namibia - Eliphas Shivute (25th)</p>
<p>In Accra, Ghana:</p>
<p>Liberia 0 Tunisia 1 (half-time 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Riadh Jelassi (88th)</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p>    Egypt	1  1  0  0  7  1  3</p>
<p>    Tunisia    1  1  0  0  1  0  3</p>
<p>    Liberia    1  0  0  1  0  1  0</p>
<p>    Namibia    1  0  0  1  1  7  0</p>
<p>Group Three:</p>
<p>In Johannesburg:</p>
<p>South Africa 1 Zaire 0 (half-time 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Phil Masinga (72nd)</p>
<p>In Brazzaville:</p>
<p>Congo 1 Zambia 0 (half-time 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Olivier Niere (41st)</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p>    Congo	   1  1  0  0  1  0  3</p>
<p>South Africa  1  1  0  0  1  0  3</p>
<p>    Zaire	   1  0  0  1  0  1  0</p>
<p>    Zambia	  1  0  0  1  0  1  0</p>
<p>Group Four:</p>
<p>In Luanda:</p>
<p>Angola 2 Zimbabwe 1 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Angola - Akwa (42nd), Paulao (54th)</p>
<p>Zimbabwe - Agent Sawu (60th)</p>
<p>In Lome:</p>
<p>Togo 2 Cameroon 4 (1-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Togo - Franck Fiawoo (51st), Salou Tadjou (83rd penalty)</p>
<p>Cameroon - Alphonse Tchami (18th, 30th), Patrick Mboma (53rd), Jean-Jacques Misse Misse (68th)</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p>    Cameroon    1  1  0  0  4  2  3</p>
<p>    Angola	1  1  0  0  2  1  3</p>
<p>    Zimbabwe    1  0  0  1  1  2  0</p>
<p>    Togo	  1  0  0  1  2  4  0</p>
<p>Group Five:</p>
<p>In Rabat:</p>
<p>Morocco 4 Sierra Leone 0 (1-0)</p>
